# NetSuite exports. These are the SOURCE of the shipment snapshot and carry container numbers,
# BOLs, forwarders, vendors and PO numbers — the whole reason the data moved out of the bundle and
# behind a login. `npm run push:snapshot` reads one from wherever it was downloaded and sends it to
# Supabase; nothing needs a copy in the repo, and a copy in the repo is a copy on GitHub.
*.csv

